INSERT INTO `field_data_field_course_description` VALUES ('taxonomy_term','exam_layout',0,128,128,'und',0,'<p>The PC Engineer (A+) is a course to benefit anyone and everyone seeking a professional level of competence and recognition within the PC Industry, regardless of your current level of ability. Successful completion of this course will see you gain an International qualification that is recognised throughout the computer industry at TSM. </p>\r\n\r\n<p>The A+ examination by CompTIA is widely recognised throughout the computer industry and is a significant declaration of skill and understanding. For some it is more than sufficient to secure a career as a computer technician, for others it provides the springboard for further study for careers in computer networking, network support and the Internet.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Regardless of your current level of ability, this course will guide you safely through this dynamic and fascinating subject. It will enable and equip you to know your computer inside-out .</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The objective is for you to become A+ certified.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>A+ is a certification sponsored by CompTIA - the Computing Technology Industry Association. Virtually every computer company of consequence is a member; Microsoft, Novell, Sun, IBM, HP, Apple, Intel and so on.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The A+ certification was created in 1993 and is now considered to be the de-facto requirement for entrance into the PC industry as a support technician.</p>','full_html'),('taxonomy_term','exam_layout',0,130,130,'und',0,'The Cisco Certified Network Professional (CCNP) credential shows your fundamental level understanding of networking. Install, configure, and operate local area networks, wide area networks and dial access services for medium to large sized networks.','full_html'),('taxonomy_term','exam_layout',0,146,146,'und',0,'This is Enterprise Administrator Course','full_html'),('taxonomy_term','exam_layout',0,153,153,'und',0,'<p>This course will lead you to the highly regarded N+ qualification - increasingly the industry\'s examination of choice for computer network engineers. For many it is more than sufficient to secure a job as a network or support technician, and for others, it provides the catalyst for further study and to pursue professional status following either CCNA/CCNP (Cisco) or MCSA/MCSE (Microsoft) career paths.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>This course is intended for individuals interested in learning about the CompTIA Network+ qualification and is specifically designed to prepare students for this valuable certification exam. The successful completion of this course will see you gain an internationally recognised qualification which together with the A+ exam, can count toward the highly acclaimed MCSA/MCSE exams.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The N+ examination by CompTIA is widely recognised throughout the computer industry and is a significant declaration of skills and understanding. It will teach you what you need to know about installing, configuring and troubleshooting networking hardware, peripherals and protocols.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Regardless of your current level of ability, this course will guide you safely through this dynamic and fascinating subject. It will enable and equip you for \"real world\" demands of today\'s computer networking industry.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>About Net Master (N+) Certification</h3>\r\n<p>The objective is for you to become CompTIA Network+ certified.\r\n\r\nN+ is a qualification sponsored by CompTIA, the Computing Technology Industry Association. Virtually every computer company of consequence is a member; Microsoft, Novell, Sun, IBM, HP, Apple, Intel and so on. The N+ certification has rapidly become the de facto standard for entry into PC industry as a networks technician</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Students may choose to undertake this course with or without practical class training. For those who choose to include practical training within their course, the following details apply.\r\n\r\nThe student will not require practical training before the successful completion of Parts A-B of the course. The practical training is designed to reinforce the syllabus and answer any questions the student may have regarding specific areas. All arrangements for the use of a computer for practice lessons will be carried out by TSM. TSM will always strive to arrange suitable times and venues but reserves the right to change venues and times for computer practice as needs dictate.</p>','full_html'),('taxonomy_term','exam_layout',0,154,154,'und',0,'<p>Validate your skills in server support with CompTIA Server+ certification, the industry standard of competency for IT technicians responsible for server hardware functionality.\r\nTSM will provide you with all the training you need to pass the Server+ exam (SK0-002) and get certified.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>CompTIA Server+ certification is vendor- and product-neutral, and validates your technical leadership in server issues and technology.\r\n\r\nIt proves you are knowledgeable in areas such as RAID, SCSI and multiple CPUs, and have capabilities with disaster recovery.\r\nAlthough not a prerequisite, it is recommended that CompTIA Server+ candidates hold a CompTIA A+ certification.</p>','full_html');
/*!40000 ALTER TABLE `field_data_field_course_description` ENABLE KEYS */;
UNLOCK TABLES;

