ed for the majority of our courses. This service provides you with the opportunity to test your knowledge in a simulated, certification-testing environment.all our courses include VLE( Virtual Learning Enviornment) an online resource containing relevant resources.','plain_text',0),(269,14,'What do my fees cover?','Your fees include course ware, hands-on simulations, user guides and product documentation, a test prep service and technical and learning support. All of our courses include VLE account and access to online relevant resources.','plain_text',0),(270,14,'How do I enroll?','We\'ve made the enrollment process as easy as possible. All you have to do is to fill the information request on the right side of this web page about the course of your choice and a TSM Learning consultant will contact you. To make enrollment as easy and convenient as possible for you, we\'ll take care of much of the paperwork involved.','plain_text',0),(271,15,'Network Professional','<p>Sample content for website. Sample content for website. Sample content for website. Sample content for website. Sample content for website. Sample content for website</p>\r\n<p>Sample content for website. Sample content for website. Sample content for website. Sample content for website. Sample content for website. Sample content for website</p>','plain_text',5),(272,15,'Systems Engineer','<p>Sample content for website. Sample content for website. Sample content for website. Sample content for website. Sample content for website. Sample content for website</p>\r\n<p>Sample content for website. Sample content for website. Sample content for website. Sample content for website. Sample content for website. Sample content for website</p>','plain_text',4),(273,15,'Server Administrator','<p>Sample content for website. Sample content for website. Sample content for website. Sample content for website. Sample content for website. Sample content for website</p>\r\n<p>Sample content for website. Sample content for